{"release":{"id":297242448,"tag":"v0.14.2","author":"github-actions[bot]","name":"v0.14.2","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-03-15T21:55:30Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-15T22:31:45Z","markdown":"# Brax v0.14.2 Release Notes\n\n* **Distributional PPO Support**: Added a distributional critic to capture return\nvariance, leading to more reliable advantage estimates and improved policy\nupdates (reference: https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.10044).\n* Parametrize CNN networks in brax PPO.\n","html":"<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\">Brax v0.14.2 Release Notes</h1><a id=\"user-content-brax-v0142-release-notes\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Brax v0.14.2 Release Notes\" href=\"#brax-v0142-release-notes\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Distributional PPO Support</strong>: Added a distributional critic to capture return\nvariance, leading to more reliable advantage estimates and improved policy\nupdates (reference: <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.10044\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.10044</a>).</li>\n<li>Parametrize CNN networks in brax PPO.</li>\n</ul>\n","assets":[]}}